@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:19100
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCALLY_OBTAINED_JWT

### Readonly schemas; USER JWT required
GET {{gateway}}/api/ai/agent/tools
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Controlled tool loop; requires an imported tenant document
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### No external-processing consent: 400 before any provider call
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":false}

### Spoofed owner is not a request field: 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/agent/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":true,"ownerId":8}
